6c098b3eae1fe439cee76b86bd9", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/dab3b026/uploads/origins/0012aec3-9c96-4821-b607-a76848813716?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=80a21dee8e9993db53afa5720418dd2e", "src_set": ""}, "body": "Hi! Can I have a commission about Reimu being tickled? You can take P1 as reference. Reimu’s feet are locked by wooden board shackle. Her hands are tied and you can design a gesture to expose her armpits. Her shoes and socks are put near the shackle. Two brushes are tickling Reimu’s soles and two flying hands are tickling her armpits. Reimu’s is laughing loudly with tears out and struggling madly. By the way, you can let her eyes all open largely or all closed tightly. Do not try one open and another closed. That’s not a good choice.\n\nP1: You can see the URL\n\nhttps://www.pixiv.net/en/artworks/124127683", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@MOZUPOKO/works/9", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3639466, "client_id": 3510861, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/0f79fd7e/uploads/origins/7238e33f-2141-40ba-b128-e450d6d3f8fd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cc987aa0223f267b0391d9d5b39d7ea4", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/0f79fd7e/uploads/origins/7238e33f-2141-40ba-b128-e450d6d3f8fd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=349812ddf49f9226929861e8b5af1c41", "src_set": ""}, "body": "こんにちは！SNSであなたの絵を何枚か見て、マジで可愛いと思って...。もしよければ、私のキャラクターに何かリクエストしたいです。\n\n彼女は物静かで控えめなドラゴンの女の子。ちょっと本当にバカで、物事をすぐに忘れてしまうし、できるだけ受け身で生きている。彼女自身の物語でさえ傍観者だが、それでも数時間余分に睡眠をとることができる限り、それに満足している。彼女は氷の彫刻家